{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11307130","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11307130","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1130713001:1":{"text":"唉，自从深红高原传出宝藏传说后，附近部族不少族民外出后都失踪了。","source_cn":"唉，自从深红高原传出宝藏传说后，附近部族不少族民外出后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09490E0D969028FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130713002:1":{"text":"有人说，他们都是被流沙之爪的那帮强盗抓走了。","source_cn":"有人说，他们都是被流沙之爪的那帮强盗抓走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE26D49E78097F534","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130713003:1":{"text":"但是，如果流沙之爪真的敢伤害我的女儿，我一定会和他们拼命的！","source_cn":"但是，如果流沙之爪真的敢伤害我的女儿，我一定会和他们拼命的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7B81C094B22AADE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130713004:1":{"text":"我只剩下小塔拉了，无论如何都要保护好她！","source_cn":"我只剩下小塔拉了，无论如何都要保护好她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x938BED7EA87E6AA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:部落成员登利":{"text":"部落成员登利","source":"部落成员登利","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}